{
  "name": "Medical Document Processor - Intake (Webhook)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "node-sticky-1",
      "name": "Read Me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 460,
        "height": 380,
        "content": "## Medical Document Processor intake\n\nThis workflow is a thin webhook proxy in front of the\n`MedicalDocumentProcessor` FastAPI service (port 8029).\n\n**Caller contract (identical to the service's own API):**\nPOST multipart/form-data with fields:\n- `file` (the document)\n- `patient` (JSON string: patient_id, full_name, sex, date_of_birth)\n- `translate` (\"true\"/\"false\", optional)\n- `target_language` (optional)\n- `existing_documents` (JSON array string, optional)\n\n**Test with the service's own samples/, e.g.:**\n```\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:5678/webhook-test/medical-document-processor \\\n  -F \"file=@samples/jane_doe_lab_result.txt\" \\\n  -F \"patient=<samples/patients/jane_doe.json\" \\\n  -F \"translate=false\"\n```\n\n**Output routing is NOT decided yet.** The `processed` branch\ncurrently just tags + returns the structured_data to the caller.\nWire it into hospital.db / Postgres / Sheets / Slack once you\ndecide where results should land."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-webhook",
      "name": "Document Intake Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [480, 200],
      "webhookId": "a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "medical-document-processor",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-normalize",
      "name": "Normalize Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [720, 200],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const item = $input.first();\nconst body = item.json.body ?? item.json ?? {};\n\nfunction asString(value) {\n  if (value === undefined || value === null) return '';\n  if (typeof value === 'string') return value;\n  return JSON.stringify(value);\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    patient: asString(body.patient),\n    translate: (body.translate === true || body.translate === 'true') ? 'true' : 'false',\n    target_language: asString(body.target_language),\n    existing_documents: asString(body.existing_documents)\n  },\n  binary: item.binary\n}];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-http-request",
      "name": "Call Document Processor API",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [960, 200],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:8029/api/v1/process-document",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "multipart-form-data",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "parameterType": "formBinaryData", "name": "file", "inputDataFieldName": "file" },
            { "parameterType": "formData", "name": "patient", "value": "={{ $json.patient }}" },
            { "parameterType": "formData", "name": "translate", "value": "={{ $json.translate }}" },
            { "parameterType": "formData", "name": "target_language", "value": "={{ $json.target_language }}" },
            { "parameterType": "formData", "name": "existing_documents", "value": "={{ $json.existing_documents }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-switch",
      "name": "Route by Pipeline Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [1200, 120],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "rules",
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "outputKey": "invalid",
              "conditions": {
                "combinator": "and",
                "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "typeValidation": "strict", "version": 2 },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "cond-invalid",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
                    "rightValue": "invalid",
                    "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "renameOutput": true
            },
            {
              "outputKey": "irrelevant",
              "conditions": {
                "combinator": "and",
                "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "typeValidation": "strict", "version": 2 },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "cond-irrelevant",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
                    "rightValue": "irrelevant",
                    "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "renameOutput": true
            },
            {
              "outputKey": "processed",
              "conditions": {
                "combinator": "and",
                "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "typeValidation": "strict", "version": 2 },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "cond-processed",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
                    "rightValue": "processed",
                    "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "renameOutput": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra"
        }
      }
    },
    {
